    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >POWER LINE RIDER</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564680/extras/ce15ccc957cbc0481020eb3774b7df62.poster.avif?t=1751093573\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564680/extras/ce15ccc957cbc0481020eb3774b7df62.webm?t=1751093573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564680/extras/ce15ccc957cbc0481020eb3774b7df62.mp4?t=1751093573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Embark on an <strong>action-packed journey</strong> in Power Line Rider, diving players into an all new <strong>hand-pixeled</strong> world. Assume the role of John Glider, veteran member of the Power Line Rider organization. Venture out to <strong>Reestablish contact</strong> with 3 bases that have recently gone dark in this post-apocalyptic world where the fastest means of travel is riding on old power lines.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY MODE / ENDLESS MODE</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564680/extras/4d534495c427a8f4ddad92e3d5ae60f3.poster.avif?t=1751093573\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564680/extras/4d534495c427a8f4ddad92e3d5ae60f3.webm?t=1751093573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564680/extras/4d534495c427a8f4ddad92e3d5ae60f3.mp4?t=1751093573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Beat the <strong>3 Bosses</strong> in the concise &quot;<strong>Story Mode</strong>&quot; to unlock the thrilling and addictive &quot;<strong>Endless Mode</strong>&quot;. Enter the <strong>NegaZone</strong> and ride through ever increasing difficulty all the way to Infinity! (Or as long as you can survive!)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564680/extras/99fe95035e59a51e5646b0713761298b.poster.avif?t=1751093573\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564680/extras/99fe95035e59a51e5646b0713761298b.webm?t=1751093573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564680/extras/99fe95035e59a51e5646b0713761298b.mp4?t=1751093573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>For All Ages:</strong> With 3 difficulty settings, Easy, Normal, and Hard, Power Line Rider caters to all ages and skill levels!<br></li><li><strong>Charming Pixel Art Graphics:</strong> Immerse yourself in a 2D retro pixel art world reminiscent of classic 8-bit games. Bask in the nostalgia! <br></li><li><strong>Procedurally Placed Enemies:</strong> All enemies are placed procedurally, so every play through is different!<br></li><li><strong>Energetic Soundtrack:</strong> Enjoy original Chiptune melodies, full of energy, paying homage to the 8-bit console era!</li></ul>",
