e through ever increasing difficulty all the way to Infinity! (Or as long as you can survive!)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564680/extras/99fe95035e59a51e5646b0713761298b.poster.avif?t=1751093573\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564680/extras/99fe95035e59a51e5646b0713761298b.webm?t=1751093573\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564680/extras/99fe95035e59a51e5646b0713761298b.mp4?t=1751093573\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>For All Ages:</strong> With 3 difficulty settings, Easy, Normal, and Hard, Power Line Rider caters to all ages and skill levels!<br></li><li><strong>Charming Pixel Art Graphics:</strong> Immerse yourself in a 2D retro pixel art world reminiscent of classic 8-bit games. Bask in the nostalgia! <br></li><li><strong>Procedurally Placed Enemies:</strong> All enemies are placed procedurally, so every play through is different!<br></li><li><strong>Energetic Soundtrack:</strong> Enjoy original Chiptune melodies, full of energy, paying homage to the 8-bit console era!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "It's time to ride! Dodge colorful animals and Defeat Bosses to conquer the Power Lines in this Retro Arcade game with a short Story Mode. Complete the Story to unlock Endless Mode and explore the infinite &quot;NegaZone&quot;. You'll enjoy simple controls, classic 8-bit visuals, and an energetic soundtrack!",
